data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":86,"item_id":"rs_00e5b312eb8d909a016acaba70fa5481938ff734cc64a0ca3b","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Structuring transaction history**\n\nI need to set up a straightforward history table for tracking transactions, where I can insert or ignore each startup safely. The idea is to create a synchronized history with a tasks column used for sorting. I’m considering implementing helper functions for transactions, creating tasks, and recording them through “insert select.” I should also work on migrating the current data while ensuring I test correctly, updating expectations to make them more robust."}

